tests. All patients received one of the two chemotherapy regimens studied in this trial, for eight courses in the case  
of patients with complete or partial response, and subsequently were randomized to receive delayed thoracic radiotherapy
after these eight courses. RESULTS In comparison to the 139 patients who did not receive heparin, the 138 patients who  
