{"study_index": 15, "title": "A randomized phase II trial of Apixaban for the prevention of thromboembolism in patients 
with metastatic cancer", "abstract": "BACKGROUND Cancer patients receiving chemotherapy are at increased risk for       
thrombosis. Apixaban, a factor Xa inhibitor, is oral and does not require laboratory monitoring. OBJECTIVES A pilot     
