"title": "Venous thromboembolism prophylaxis and treatment in cancer: a consensus statement of major guidelines panels  
and call to action", "abstract": "PURPOSE Venous thromboembolism (VTE) is an increasingly frequent complication of      
cancer and its treatments, and is associated with worsened mortality and morbidity in patients with cancer. DESIGN The  
Italian Association of Medical Oncology, the National Comprehensive Cancer Network, the American Society of Clinical    
