│ Springer"}, {"study_index": 74, "title": "Targeting protein disulfide isomerase with the flavonoid isoquercetin to   │
│ improve hypercoagulability in advanced cancer", "abstract": "BACKGROUND. Protein disulfide isomerase (PDI) is a      │
│ thiol isomerase secreted by vascular cells that is required for thrombus formation. Quercetin flavonoids inhibit PDI │
